description:
Number of PLHIV active in care who received at least one documented psychosocial care or support intervention during the reporting period.
Criteria:
Intervention encounter occurred between :startDate and :endDate;
client is active in care;
at least one documented intervention/service was provided;
coded negative screening values alone should not qualify;
qualifying evidence includes counselling, peer support, adherence support, PHDP services, referrals/linkages, OVC services, GBV-related support, or other documented psychosocial interventions.
